  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in initiated offensive strikes produces sudden risk shocks and news-driven repricing across fixed-income markets, increasing intraday and realized volatility as investors rapidly reassess sovereign and term premia.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_iran_confrontation</data>
