  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A sustained increase in Russian offensive attacks compels the US and NATO to redeploy naval, air and ground assets to Europe for deterrence and reinforcement, reducing the scale of forces and platforms the US can keep deployed in the Middle East vis-à-vis Iran.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
