  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">A rise in hostile or disruptive incidents against commercial ships prompts rapid redeployments of US naval and air assets for escorts, patrols and deterrence in the affected sea lanes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">energy_maritime_chokepoi</data>
  <data key="d40">us_iran_confrontation</data>
